# Load order is the dependency order: Config exports the binding lookup and the secret guard, Names the
# one rule for comparing player names, Actions the three things a binding can do, and Hooks wires the click
# surfaces to all of them. UI only reads what Config already set up.

Core\Config.lua
Core\Names.lua
Core\Actions.lua
Core\Hooks.lua
UI\Options.lua
